This is an Assert statement that checks if the value of `Old_arrListLastIndexOfX` is greater than or equal to 0. If it's not, an exception will be thrown. This particular line is checking that the index where a certain value `x` was last in the list before the operation, is greater than or equal to 0. If it's not, it could indicate an error during the operation.--------------------The assertion that needs to be translated is "the last position of x in old array is greater than or equal to some position of x in the same array".

